ggao50 랙-피니언 그리퍼는 닫힘 부하가 35 % 라 upstream 의 과부하 25 % 가
정상 동작에서 걸린다. 스톡 그리퍼는 --robot.gripper_protection=true 로 복원.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019AkefRzDeCsGU6nqQtRZuh
---
 src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/config_so_follower.py | 7 +++++++
 src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/so_follower.py        | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/config_so_follower.py b/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/config_so_follower.py
index af4dda78..e820a535 100644
--- a/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/config_so_follower.py
+++ b/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/config_so_follower.py
@@ -46,6 +46,13 @@ class SOFollowerConfig:
     position_i_coefficient: int = 0
     position_d_coefficient: int = 32
 
+    # Upstream lerobot lowers the gripper motor's Max_Torque_Limit / Protection_Current /
+    # Overload_Torque at connect time (500 / 250 / 25) to protect the stock SO-101 gripper.
+    # The ggao50 rack-and-pinion gripper draws ~35 % torque just to close, so those values
+    # trip its overload protection. Local default is off; pass --robot.gripper_protection=true
+    # to restore upstream behaviour for a stock gripper. (bimanual-robot, 2026-09-09)
+    gripper_protection: bool = False
+
     # Number of extra attempts when a `sync_read` of the motors fails. Feetech buses can occasionally
     # return a corrupted status packet ("Incorrect status packet!"), especially when several joints move
     # at once, which otherwise aborts the control loop. Retries are immediate (no sleep) and only happen on
diff --git a/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/so_follower.py b/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/so_follower.py
index 85dc43dc..292b41f0 100644
--- a/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/so_follower.py
+++ b/src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/so_follower.py
@@ -165,7 +165,7 @@ class SOFollower(Robot):
                 self.bus.write("I_Coefficient", motor, self.config.position_i_coefficient)
                 self.bus.write("D_Coefficient", motor, self.config.position_d_coefficient)
 
-                if motor == "gripper":
+                if motor == "gripper" and self.config.gripper_protection:
                     self.bus.write("Max_Torque_Limit", motor, 500)  # 50% of max torque to avoid burnout
                     self.bus.write("Protection_Current", motor, 250)  # 50% of max current to avoid burnout
                     self.bus.write("Overload_Torque", motor, 25)  # 25% torque when overloaded
